      "type": "text",
      "content": "Details of Kshethram:\nMoolavar: Bhakthavatsala Perumal\nThayaar: Sudhavalli / Ennaipetra Thayaar\nVimanam: Utpala Vimanam\nPushkarani: Varuna Pushkarani\n\nTravel: This kshethram is situated 25 km from Chennai, on the Chennai-Tiruvaloor Road. \n\nAzhwar Pasuram: \nTirumangai Azhwar: 2 Pasurams",
